  "name": "contextOS",
  "description": "contextOS is a distributed orchestration platform for autonomous AI agents that facilitates real-time coordination, resource locking, and context management across heterogeneous IDE environments. It utilizes the proprietary Omega (\u03a9) encoding protocol to achieve significant token compression for agent-to-agent communication while maintaining a unified state backend via Convex. The system integrates Model Context Protocol (MCP) connectivity with a Windows 95-inspired dashboard and a high-performance terminal interface for system-wide observability.",
